  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "种子流尚未就绪（引擎返回 HTTP {status}）。它可能仍在从对等端获取元数据。",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "无法安装更新：{error}",
  "Theme": "主题",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "这里勉强只放得下一部电影。请在盒子上插入一个 U 盘——格式化为 FAT32，所有 Android 盒子都能识别——它会出现在上方，供你改为下载到那里。",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "没有账户可登录，也没有任何内容同步到服务器。你看了什么、看到哪里、你的收藏和待看列表，全都存放在本设备上，从不外传。跨屏幕同步已在计划之中；在此之前，下面的备份文件就是媒体库搬家的方式。",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "你的文档文件夹里没有 {file}。请复制一份过去后重试。",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "当前连接按流量计费。",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "当前连接不按流量计费。",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "本设备的解码器放弃了该文件。原因通常出在音频：Dolby（AC-3、E-AC-3、TrueHD）和 DTS 未在系统 webview 中获得授权，因此带有这类音频的资源只会有画面没有声音，或者根本无法播放。使用 AAC 音频的 x264 资源可以正常播放。",
  "This file has one audio track.": "该文件只有一条音轨。",
  "This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.",
